title one reading, two numbers
prompt Keaton chose to raise the pin bound for session-logs rather than lower the room bound.
think Derived the number rather than granting one. The room holds 256 flat files, the index holds one row each, a row is bounded at 192 bytes -- so rows need 49,152, and 8,192 for prose brings it to 57,344, a clean multiple of 1024 and roughly three times the 2,678 the page carries.
think The argument for an exception rather than a new general number is that the two bound different readings. 24,576 is stated in the law as ~6k tokens, a pin an agent reads in one breath, which bounds a page read WHOLE. An index is read from the TOP -- the loop's own instruction is to open a lap on the newest rows and the newest recommend line.
think REDS %199 taught that a constant with two homes disagrees with itself, so the exception had to cost no second reading. Taught living_pin_max_bytes.sh to take an optional page path and answer per page, general by default.
think Anchored the exception match on the whole bracketed path. A substring match would let a/README.md answer for x/a/README.md, and the control proves both directions of that.
obs Five meters read the bound and each measures pages. declared_ceiling and index_fold resolve per page inside their loops now; living_docs_roster and living_docs_lint do the same for discovered pages, and the lint's 90% near-bound advisory follows the page's own number rather than the general one. equinox_e123 gates a named roster of ten that session-logs was never on, checked rather than assumed.
obs All five were green before the change and would have stayed green today, since the pin sits at 8,814 bytes. They would have refused it the moment it grew into the room the law now permits -- a latent fault fixed while the reason was in hand rather than when a lap tripped over it.
obs bounds_disagree reads 0, so the 57,344 the page spells and the 57,344 the law answers for that page are one number. bounds_over reads 0 across all 14 declaring pages.
loom bound page=session-logs/README.md general=24576 page_bound=57344 derivation=256x192+8192 pin_bytes=8814
loom control=declared_ceiling checks=57 new=7 meters_taught=4
