file tools/fixtures/declared_ceiling_scan.sh per-page resolution inside the bound comparison
file tools/fixtures/index_fold_scan.sh per-page resolution for each room's pin
file tools/fixtures/living_docs_roster_scan.sh per-page resolution for discovered pages
file tools/fixtures/living_docs_lint_scan.sh per-page resolution, near-bound line following the page
file tools/fixtures/declared_ceiling_control.sh seven checks including both anchoring failures
file construction/REDS.md %205 closed with the choice; %203-%204 folded
recommend keep-going the two older gates stand -- the invariant-coverage ceiling at 13,235 asserts, and whether a planted fixture name can be discovered rather than listed
